{"script":"yd_014_07","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1","mirrow":false,"x":426,"trans":false,"y":-31,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1a","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":0,"x":426,"trans":false,"y":-31,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"timeBak":300,"addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1a","nonStandBright":false,"noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]在自卫团做的事还挺有趣的，完全不会感觉枯燥。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]之前在魔物途径的山路上铺了陷阱，正好碰到几只恐兽游荡过来，你猜怎么着？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]恐兽居然真的会扑棱翅膀，哈哈哈哈哈哈！结果扑棱半天还是掉了下去，乐死我了。顺带一提恐兽肉其实挺鲜嫩的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]除了这些乐子，能保护村民们这事确实也挺有成就感的。山村资源匮乏，有时候要从荒野客或者路过的佣兵团之类的人那里抢物资。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]自己人都快没饭吃了，我还管什么外人。要不是物尽其用，在那种荒山野岭里根本养不起一村子人。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":0,"x":426,"trans":false,"y":-31,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"timeBak":300,"addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1a","nonStandBright":false,"noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"皮塔-自卫团生活"}